  "details": "so i cant launch steamVR anymore well sort of... its complicated. its on the quest link desktop is how to activate it for me but it used to be on the library. Anywho, when I try launching vrchat on steamVR it would say on my vr headset for vrchat as \"next up\" but that is a stuck loading screen but it'll boot it up on my desktop mode instead of VR mode. one of my friends told me i have everything active and launches correctly but it wouldn't display it in my vr headset... which is a quest 2. since the update yesterday when i got home and tried launching it at 11:47pm of August 14th it doesn't seem to work like how it used to anymore. other games that i have on steamVR like payday 2 works perfectly fine and would display it even in VR Mode when i use it on SteamVR but not VrChat. I've started to notice the error prompt for when i use steamVR and it would give me an error code of 109. which says \"TITLE: SteamVR Error.\" the description says \" SteamVR failed to intialize for unknown reasons. (Error: Not Intialized (109)(109))...  i have tried roughly almost everything for the error prompt and that doesnt even help. Please any help for this new update?",
